   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Burkina Faso, Mali and Senegal for Finalization of the Regional GCF Project SURAGGWA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To achieve specific climate change impacts (mitigation  adaptation) through: (i) transformative interventions in ecosystem restoration, sequestering large amounts of CO2 with significant other environmental and social co-benefits; (ii) strengthening smallholder value chains of non-timber forest products (NTFP) and other produce from restored land, including fodder, to ensure they are more equitable, inclusive (gender, youth), sustainable and resilient to Sahelian climate extremes and mitigate emissions; and (iii)	strengthening the capacities of the PAGGW and of the national GGW Institutions in scaling up climate action, knowledge management and monitoring and evaluation.</narrative>
  </description>
